<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Halliburton said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Halliburton said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette downgraded Halliburton Co to market perform from outperform, a trading source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 60-7/8 Tuesday.</p>
</text>
